From 635f9a74060fd46a0b39fa5dfd17a2535862f159 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Beyley Cardellio <ep1cm1n10n123@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 17:57:31 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 55/63] a/math: Refactor m_relation_history into templated C++
 API

This allows subclasses to tack on extra info, like covariance,
along with replacing prediction/interpolation with functions
that handle that extra data.

This also means the previously "wrapper" C++ API is removed in favour of
the now public C++ internals.

Signed-off-by: Beyley Cardellio <ep1cm1n10n123@gmail.com>
Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/monado/monado/-/merge_requests/3099>
